# Sponge 1: a butter yellow bath sponge lying scrub side up, 3.4 m long, 2.4 m wide and 1 m tall (30 times life size): the yellow body underneath, the
# mint scrub layer a puffy mat on top. The pores and the scrub's pits are the materials' speckle patterns. Knee cover; convex collider.
format 1
collider convex

Detail detail=0.4
    Intersection
        Union
            Material material=bath_sponge_yellow
                Translate translation=(0, 0.3, 0)
                    RoundBox size=(1.7, 0.3, 1.2) roundness=0.28
            # The scrub: a cushion on top, domed so it has no flat top
            Material material=bath_scrub_mint
                SmoothUnion smoothness=0.15
                    Translate translation=(0, 0.66, 0)
                        RoundBox size=(1.64, 0.18, 1.12) roundness=0.18
                    Translate translation=(0, 0.66, 0)
                        Ellipsoid radii=(1.4, 0.34, 0.9)
        Plane normal=(0, -1, 0) height=0
